<%# Layout for `:hint`-variant responses fetched by the gem's hint
    controller via explicit `hint_url:`. The view is expected to
    emit a `<template id="turbo-overlay-hint">…</template>` via the
    `turbo_overlay_hint do … end` helper — either in the page's
    regular `show.html.erb` (which also drives the inline-prefetch
    path) or in a dedicated `show.html+hint.erb` variant template.
    The gem's JS finds the template in the response body via
    DOMParser+querySelector regardless of where it lives. This
    layout's only job is to skip the host app's full layout so the
    response stays lean. %>
<%= yield %>
